            <note corresp="#d773-f2" n="90" xml:id="d773-f2-content">
                <p>The Saadabad Pact, signed by Afghanistan, Iraq, Iran, and Turkey; League of
                    Nations Treaty Series, Vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">cxc</hi>, p. 21.</p>
            </note>
